    "A canceled drag keeps your screenshots. After an accepted drop, files remain readable for two minutes so the destination can finish loading them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A canceled drag keeps your screenshots. After an accepted drop, files remain readable for two minutes so the destination can finish loading them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消拖动会保留截图。成功放置后，文件仍会保留两分钟，供目标应用完成读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few keywords describing the setting, like \"hide notch full screen\" or \"music waveform bars\".": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A few keywords describing the setting, like \"hide notch full screen\" or \"music waveform bars\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "描述此设置的关键词，例如“全屏隐藏刘海”或“音乐波形条”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A live activity with the app's icon and a timer while you're in a meeting, on a call, recording, or connected to another Mac. Click it for controls.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A live activity with the app's icon and a timer while you're in a meeting, on a call, recording, or connected to another Mac. Click it for controls."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开会、通话、录制或连接另一台 Mac 时，显示带应用图标和计时的实时活动，点击即可控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A live activity with the app's icon and progress while something downloads, copies or arrives over AirDrop.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A live activity with the app's icon and progress while something downloads, copies or arrives over AirDrop."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载、复制或通过隔空投送接收文件时，显示带应用图标与进度的实时活动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A live status item for the paired phone. Click it for a detailed connectivity view.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A live status item for the paired phone. Click it for a detailed connectivity view."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示配对手机的实时状态，点击查看详细连接信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new way to experience your Mac's notch.\nLet's get you set up.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A new way to experience your Mac's notch.\nLet's get you set up."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以全新方式使用 Mac 刘海。\n现在开始设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A real Notification Center banner, with reply and action buttons.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A real Notification Center banner, with reply and action buttons."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示真正的通知中心横幅，包含回复和操作按钮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A second click on empty menu bar space also shows the always-hidden section. The first click still shows hidden items right away": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A second click on empty menu bar space also shows the always-hidden section. The first click still shows hidden items right away"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再次点击菜单栏空白处还会显示始终隐藏的区域；第一次点击仍会立即显示普通隐藏项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A valid directory is required.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A valid directory is required."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择有效的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A widget in the notch with running work and today's Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Antigravity and Gemini usage. Click it for the full dashboard and a command runner.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A widget in the notch with running work and today's Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Antigravity and Gemini usage. Click it for the full dashboard and a command runner."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在刘海中查看进行中的任务，以及今日 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor、Antigravity 和 Gemini 用量。点击可打开完整面板和命令运行器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
