    "Football and Formula 1 use the latest reported provider data. Live timing refreshes about every 15 seconds; provider delays can apply.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Football and Formula 1 use the latest reported provider data. Live timing refreshes about every 15 seconds; provider delays can apply."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "足球与 F1 使用数据源最新报告的数据。实时计时约每 15 秒刷新一次，数据源可能存在延迟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For OpenBubbles": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For OpenBubbles"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于 OpenBubbles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For Pro and Ultra, a Cloudflare tunnel starts in parallel while Wi-Fi is connecting so mirroring, files and the camera keep going if the local path is slow. If the devices are on different networks, local Wi-Fi is skipped. Still end-to-end encrypted with your pairing key.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For Pro and Ultra, a Cloudflare tunnel starts in parallel while Wi-Fi is connecting so mirroring, files and the camera keep going if the local path is slow. If the devices are on different networks, local Wi-Fi is skipped. Still end-to-end encrypted with your pairing key."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro 与 Ultra 在连接 Wi-Fi 时并行启动 Cloudflare 隧道，确保本地连接较慢时镜像、文件与摄像头仍可使用。设备不在同一网络时跳过本地 Wi-Fi，仍使用配对密钥端到端加密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a change: the exact key of the listed setting to change. Otherwise empty.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For a change: the exact key of the listed setting to change. Otherwise empty."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更改时填写所列设置的准确键名，否则留空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a change: the new value from that setting's allowed values. on when they say turn on, enable, show or start; off when they say turn off, disable, stop or remove. A number or an option name for other settings. Otherwise empty.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For a change: the new value from that setting's allowed values. on when they say turn on, enable, show or start; off when they say turn off, disable, stop or remove. A number or an option name for other settings. Otherwise empty."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更改时填写此设置允许的新值。开启、启用、显示或开始时填 on；关闭、停用、停止或移除时填 off。其他设置填写数字或选项名称，否则留空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For devices like HomePods, show a device-specific icon in the volume HUD.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For devices like HomePods, show a device-specific icon in the volume HUD."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对 HomePod 等设备，在音量浮层中显示专用图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For displays you haven't switched on or off below, including ones you connect later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For displays you haven't switched on or off below, including ones you connect later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于下方未单独开启或关闭的显示器，包括今后连接的显示器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For logged-in Spotify accounts, hide the music widget when Spotify is not running on this Mac and Spotify is the only media source.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For logged-in Spotify accounts, hide the music widget when Spotify is not running on this Mac and Spotify is the only media source."
          }
        },
