            "value": "Menu Bar Line automatically replaces the idle capsule on external displays with a thin handle. Hover or click to open. Built-in displays keep their original style; live activities and expanded panels keep their content."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "菜单栏细条会在外接屏上自动替代闲置胶囊，悬停或点击即可展开。内置屏保留原有样式，实时活动和展开面板仍正常显示内容。"
