    "Models load when Face ID starts and are freed when it ends, saving about 150–180 MB. Each unlock waits about 0.3 s for the models to load, up to 2 s when macOS has dropped its model cache.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Models load when Face ID starts and are freed when it ends, saving about 150–180 MB. Each unlock waits about 0.3 s for the models to load, up to 2 s when macOS has dropped its model cache."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "面容识别开始时加载模型，结束时释放，可节省约 150–180 MB 内存。每次解锁约需等待 0.3 秒；macOS 清理模型缓存后可能需 2 秒。"
          }
        }
      }
