    "Press and hold secondary player buttons (Queue, Devices, Like, Shuffle, Repeat) for an alternate action. Previous / Next / Play are tap-only unless you assign a hold action below. When this is off, Previous/Next still seek while held.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press and hold secondary player buttons (Queue, Devices, Like, Shuffle, Repeat) for an alternate action. Previous / Next / Play are tap-only unless you assign a hold action below. When this is off, Previous/Next still seek while held."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "长按队列、设备、喜欢、随机播放和重复按钮可执行备用操作。上一首、下一首和播放默认为点按，除非在下方指定长按操作。关闭此功能后，长按上一首／下一首仍可快退／快进。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
