    "The Private API provides significantly more features and is better supported. The Official API only covers basic playback and device switching, and needs your own developer app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Private API provides significantly more features and is better supported. The Official API only covers basic playback and device switching, and needs your own developer app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私有 API 提供更多功能且支持更完善。官方 API 仅提供基本播放与设备切换，并需要你自己的开发者应用。"
          }
