    "Uses about 150–180 MB more memory. Recognition starts about 0.3 s sooner on each unlock, and up to 2 s sooner when macOS has dropped its model cache (after a restart, update, or memory pressure). Released automatically if memory runs critically low.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses about 150–180 MB more memory. Recognition starts about 0.3 s sooner on each unlock, and up to 2 s sooner when macOS has dropped its model cache (after a restart, update, or memory pressure). Released automatically if memory runs critically low."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "约多使用 150–180 MB 内存，每次解锁可提前约 0.3 秒开始识别；macOS 清理模型缓存后最多可提前 2 秒。内存严重不足时会自动释放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
