    "change only for an instruction such as \"turn off X\", \"enable X\", \"set X to 5\" or \"hide X\". question for anything asked as a question (\"can I…?\", \"how do I…?\", \"is there…?\") or a request for ideas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "change only for an instruction such as \"turn off X\", \"enable X\", \"set X to 5\" or \"hide X\". question for anything asked as a question (\"can I…?\", \"how do I…?\", \"is there…?\") or a request for ideas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅当指令为“关闭 X”“启用 X”“将 X 设为 5”或“隐藏 X”时使用 change。疑问句或寻求建议时使用 question。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
