    "macOS 27 shows and hides all of an app's items together. While items are hidden, Apple items not listed here (Focus, Now Playing, Siri, Live Activities) and apps that aren't in the Applications folder are hidden too. Clicking the clock still opens Notification Center.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 27 shows and hides all of an app's items together. While items are hidden, Apple items not listed here (Focus, Now Playing, Siri, Live Activities) and apps that aren't in the Applications folder are hidden too. Clicking the clock still opens Notification Center."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 27 会同时显示或隐藏同一应用的所有项目。隐藏时，未列出的 Apple 项目（专注、正在播放、Siri、实时活动）以及不在应用程序文件夹内的应用也会隐藏，点击时钟仍可打开通知中心。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
