          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将新截图收集到 TopLet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continuously capture newly copied text and images into TopLet history.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continuously capture newly copied text and images into TopLet history."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "持续将新复制的文本和图片收集到 TopLet 历史记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Due to changes on macOS 27 charge limiting may not work for some users. If a limit is set, TopLet will fallback to adapter mode (which cuts power from the adapter) when the limit is reach in order to enforce it. This method is under beta and may not always work, especially when the device is asleep.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Due to changes on macOS 27 charge limiting may not work for some users. If a limit is set, TopLet will fallback to adapter mode (which cuts power from the adapter) when the limit is reach in order to enforce it. This method is under beta and may not always work, especially when the device is asleep."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由于 macOS 27 的变化，部分用户的充电限制可能失效。达到已设上限时，TopLet 会尝试适配器模式，通过切断适配器供电执行限制。此方式仍在测试，尤其在设备睡眠时可能不生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Explore TopLet": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Explore TopLet"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "探索 TopLet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fanless Macs (some MacBook Air models) will show this permanently. Otherwise, ensure the TopLet helper is installed and retry.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fanless Macs (some MacBook Air models) will show this permanently. Otherwise, ensure the TopLet helper is installed and retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无风扇 Mac（部分 MacBook Air）会始终显示此状态。其他机型请确认已安装 TopLet 辅助服务，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fans return to automatic when TopLet quits.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fans return to automatic when TopLet quits."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出 TopLet 时，风扇会恢复自动控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow football and Formula 1 from TopLet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follow football and Formula 1 from TopLet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 TopLet 中关注足球与 F1。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow your favorite stocks from TopLet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follow your favorite stocks from TopLet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 TopLet 中关注喜爱的股票。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free on iPhone and Android. Drop files onto TopLet to send them to the phone; received files land in Downloads. A Continuity Live Activity tracks progress in the notch. Local Wi-Fi is fastest, with Bluetooth fallback up to 32 MB.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Free on iPhone and Android. Drop files onto TopLet to send them to the phone; received files land in Downloads. A Continuity Live Activity tracks progress in the notch. Local Wi-Fi is fastest, with Bluetooth fallback up to 32 MB."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 与安卓均可免费使用。将文件拖入 TopLet 即可发送到手机，接收文件保存在下载中，刘海实时活动显示进度。优先使用本地 Wi-Fi，蓝牙备用传输最大支持 32 MB。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Join your phone's hotspot from the TopLet menu without typing the password.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Join your phone's hotspot from the TopLet menu without typing the password."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从 TopLet 菜单加入手机热点，无需输入密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the TopLet notch bar visible at the top of the lock screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep the TopLet notch bar visible at the top of the lock screen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在锁屏顶部保持显示 TopLet 刘海顶栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep your Mac awake while TopLet's caffeinate mode is active, even with the lid closed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep your Mac awake while TopLet's caffeinate mode is active, even with the lid closed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TopLet 保持唤醒开启时，即使合盖也不让 Mac 睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps the macOS floating thumbnail available for editing and sharing. TopLet collects the file after the preview finishes and macOS saves it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps the macOS floating thumbnail available for editing and sharing. TopLet collects the file after the preview finishes and macOS saves it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留 macOS 浮动缩略图，方便编辑和分享。预览结束且 macOS 保存文件后，TopLet 再收集截图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manage quick actions and shortcut surfaces shown in TopLet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manage quick actions and shortcut surfaces shown in TopLet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "管理 TopLet 中显示的快捷操作与入口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move newly saved screenshots into TopLet's storage folder.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move newly saved screenshots into TopLet's storage folder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将新保存的截图移入 TopLet 专用文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Multi-audio won't work without Screen Recording permission. TopLet needs it to adjust app volumes, eqs and more.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Multi-audio won't work without Screen Recording permission. TopLet needs it to adjust app volumes, eqs and more."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "多音频需要屏幕录制权限，TopLet 使用该权限调整应用音量、均衡器等。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Native drives the phone as a real Bluetooth keyboard and mouse — Android's own pointer, hover, right-click and wheel. TopLet cursor draws an overlay pointer and injects gestures instead.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Native drives the phone as a real Bluetooth keyboard and mouse — Android's own pointer, hover, right-click and wheel. TopLet cursor draws an overlay pointer and injects gestures instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原生模式将手机作为真正的蓝牙键鼠控制，使用安卓自身的指针、悬停、右键与滚轮。TopLet 指针模式则绘制覆盖指针并模拟手势。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never include TopLet in screen sharing, screenshots, or screen recordings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Never include TopLet in screen sharing, screenshots, or screen recordings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "始终在屏幕共享、截图和屏幕录制中隐藏 TopLet。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New system screenshots move from their save folder into TopLet. Manually imported images are copied. The selected retention applies to new items.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "New system screenshots move from their save folder into TopLet. Manually imported images are copied. The selected retention applies to new items."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新的系统截图会从保存位置移入 TopLet，手动导入的图片会复制一份。所选保留策略适用于新项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Spotify speakers online. Open the Spotify desktop app (or another Connect device) to play audio — TopLet only controls playback.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Spotify speakers online. Open the Spotify desktop app (or another Connect device) to play audio — TopLet only controls playback."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有在线的 Spotify 扬声器。请打开 Spotify 桌面应用或其他 Connect 设备播放音频；TopLet 仅控制播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notify when the CPU stays above the threshold for 30 seconds. Requires the TopLet helper.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
